'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a cape and a [[player card]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
This [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|cosmetic set]], found on page two of the [[Cutting Edge Premium Warbond#Page 2|Cutting Edge]] Premium [[Warbond]], can be claimed separately for {{Currency|Medals|20|notext}} and 5 [[Medal]]s.

== Trivia ==
* "Martyris Rex" comes from latin, for "King of Martyrs".
** The description of the cape may be inspired by the story of Excalibur, in which only the king can lift the sword Excalibur.

